# Model checkpoints directory

## Download Pre-trained Models

The trained models are hosted on Google Drive due to their size (~938MB total).

**Google Drive Link:** [Add your Google Drive link here]

### Option 1: Manual Download
1. Download the models from Google Drive
2. Place them in this directory:
   - `code_quality_classifier_best.pt` (499MB)
   - `text_quality_classifier_best.pt` (439MB)

### Option 2: Auto Download Script
Run the download script from the training directory:
```bash
python scripts/download_models.py
```

This will automatically download the models from Google Drive to this directory.
